  "changes": [
    "a target command left running (run_in_background or moved at its timeout) is paired with a native background Bash task running the runtime-local task-wait.mjs, so native delivers its completion: into a running turn, or as an idle turn of its own with native framing",
    "the Mod rewrites that native notification to the target job id, the model's tool use id, cowboy-task:// output and the original command line (prompt, delivery and queued_command renders)",
    "TaskStop stops the native task too, so a stopped command sends nothing; collection keeps the stopped mark through concurrent reads",
    "the waiter task is allowed by a tool.check hook (no second approval) and hidden from project hooks by the hook proxy",
    "background and moved results read exactly as native's; without a native task (subagents, failed start) the notification promise is removed",
    "a timed-out command starting with sleep is killed with native's 'Exit code 143 / Command timed out after <duration>'"
  ],
