    "findings": [
      "idle completion: native starts a turn with a [SYSTEM NOTIFICATION - NOT USER INPUT] system reminder carrying <task-notification> (task-id, tool-use-id, output-file, status, summary)",
      "completion during a turn: the notification is appended to the next tool result",
      "TaskStop: no notification",
      "timeout: commands starting with sleep are killed ('Command timed out after 1s', '1m 1s'); others move to the background ('within its 2s timeout', ceil seconds) and notify",
      "$.session.receive is undefined at runtime; $.prompt.submit waits for idle and frames the text as a plugin prompt 'in the user's place'",
      "a plugin's $.tool.call of a native background Bash is notified exactly like the model's own"
    ]
  },
